  "worked_solution": "The general solution to our equation is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2x & =\\frac{\\pi }{4}+2\\pi n, & \\, & \\, & 2x=\\frac{7\\pi }{4}+2\\pi n.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSolving the two equations above for $x,$ we get:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2x & =\\frac{\\pi }{4}+2\\pi n, & \\, & \\, & 2x=\\frac{7\\pi }{4}+2\\pi n \\\\ x & =\\frac{\\pi }{8}+n\\pi , & \\, & \\, & x=\\frac{7\\pi }{8}+n\\pi \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $a=\\frac{7}{8}.$",
